Owner decision 43's differential against thomas-vilte/mls-go v1.6.0 under suite 0x0001 (§10.4), in the
mlswg's passive-client form (test-vectors.md at the commit testdata/mls/mlswg/SOURCE names): cipher_suite,
key_package, signature_priv, encryption_priv, init_priv, welcome, ratchet_tree, initial_epoch_authenticator,
and epochs of {proposals, commit, epoch_authenticator}, hex throughout. ratchet_tree is null when the
Welcome's GroupInfo carries the tree. Every leaf carries a basic credential, every member commit is a
PrivateMessage, and every key is a fresh test key of the run that recorded it.

