mls.json
    mls_*'s writing. One run of the root's TestMlsGoContinuation, recorded 2026-11-08 against the
    mlsgo.json above: mls_* joins that group as P and goes on committing in it. Its first view is Q's,
    mlsgo.json's 12 commits and then mls_*'s 8: path commits, an Add with no path and its Welcome, a
    Remove of one of mls-go's members, an external commit with ExternalInit from mls_*'s own
