    sha256 7e775b2ce8312e26fd651386b700360f625c6f95106a9c2d5c8253cf9f7695e7

Every test.sh replays each file through both stacks: the root's TestMlsGoTranscripts through mls_*, and
mlsinterop's TestMlsGoReplaysTheTranscripts through mls-go. A new mls-go pin reruns them, and
TestMlsGoIsPinned fails until they are recorded again (D-TEST-7).

To record new runs, mlsgo.json first, from mlsinterop/:
    MLSINTEROP_MLSGO_TRANSCRIPT_OUT=$PWD/../testdata/mls/0x0001/mlsgo.json \
        go test -count=1 -run TestMlsGoLifecycle .
then, from the root:
    SIDECAR_MLS_TRANSCRIPT_OUT=$PWD/testdata/mls/0x0001/mls.json \
        go test -count=1 -run TestMlsGoContinuation .
and update the sha256s above.
